&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
